{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S03、S08、S10等停留时间较短的段落仍堆积了不少小字感受，扫读压力明显大于X，容易让观众来不及消化。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用重点放大的文字迅速交代每段的核心，并通过感受与音乐进程的对应，把人物从不服气、怀念、孤独、反复动摇到最终带着伤继续生活的变化串得更清楚。它对情绪转折的铺陈、具体听觉和身体感受的描写也更细腻，能让观众不只是知道发生了什么，还能感到为什么会这样。X的双栏结构和较少的短词确实更容易快速扫读，但整体叙事抓取、音乐与心理的结合以及细节表现，Y带来的收益更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "20290c04-1c7f-4bc6-bbba-1803f8f577c8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T155916925689Z", "elapsed_seconds": 54.031, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T16:00:10.959205+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6e47755b65d50e7288238f9a7d2e929da7fe4aa7eda262b4373ab83cd05ddec0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gp